«
@@ DMOσConcord — demo of σConcord: two measurements of the same true value
@@ 10, each with a standard deviation drawn between 0.5 and 2, and a value
@@ drawn from the normal law around 10. Press the key again for a new pair:
@@ p falls below 0.05 about one time in twenty, although nothing is wrong.
@@ Author & design          : Jean Wilson
@@ Co-authors & programming  : Claude & Claude Code (Anthropic)
  0.5 2 Random 2 Round 0.5 2 Random 2 Round
  → DmSx DmSy
  «
    10 DmSx ⓁNormlRand 2 Round DmSx →σRange
    10 DmSy ⓁNormlRand 2 Round DmSy →σRange
    ⓁσConcord
  »
